You are preparing a Pull Request Produce a concise but comprehensive summary of the work performed. 
Push the branch to the remote and create a pull Request
Use the update_deliverable_state tool to change Deliverable state to CodeComplete


Requirements:
- Summarize the intent, scope, and impact of the changes.
- Describe what was added, removed, fixed, or refactored.
- Highlight any user-visible behavior changes.
- Note any new dependencies, migrations, or configuration updates.
- Describe functional changes, refactors, and fixes.
- Include any new APIs, data models, or configuration changes.
- Mention relevant tests added or updated.
- Avoid restating commit messages or listing every file changed.
- Keep the tone factual, clear, and professional.
- Limit to 3-6 short paragraphs or bullet groups.

Output format:
# Summary
<high-level overview>

# Changes
<key changes grouped logically>

# Notes
<any considerations for reviewers, migrations, or follow-up work>

